ator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, September to October came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025 on the middle, October to November came in at 42% of normal, and so far in 2026 March to April sits at 40%. Grid 21807 had its driest year in 1963 at 66% of normal.</p>"}
